TER WITH A MOTOR CAR BIT HAnTA CONTROLS. He merT LoNG\nDISTANCES AND VISITeR Me IN CANBeRRA IN THe CARLY 1930, 1 SAN HAm OFTEN\nshe Hame in CARAToN BUT He PASSeR oN SOme YORS AGO BeDra A SURReROR FROm",
